track='''<section class="inner-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="label">Track Record</div><h1 class="display">The work<br><em>speaks.</em></h1><p class="lead">An editorial point of view can also change how a brand is seen and how people engage with it.</p></div></section><div class="woven"></div><section class="section"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="label">Case study / Africa Fashion Week London</div><h2 class="heading">Repositioning<br>for relevance.</h2><p class="lead">Bluxe was brought in as a commercial partner to reshape perception, broaden the buyer audience and build new revenue streams for an established event.</p><p class="text">The supplied case study describes refreshed brand communications, a food village, VIP and boutique concepts, a business forum and new sponsorship relationships. It reports the event’s most profitable year in ten years.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="/assets/Bluxe%20Client%20Re-Brand%20%26%20Product%20Restructure%20Case%20Study.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the full case study ↗</a></div></div><div class="cast-frame"><img src="/assets/events-strip.webp" alt="Bluxe event and brand engagement archive"></div></div></section><section class="section" style="background:#111014"><div class="wrap"><div class="label">Reported historical outcomes</div><h2 class="heading">Measured<br><em>movement.</em></h2><div class="proof-metrics" style="max-width:1000px"><div><strong>+78%</strong><span>Sponsorship and advertising revenue</span></div><div><strong>+127%</strong><span>Exhibitor sales</span></div><div><strong>+205%</strong><span>Event profit</span></div></div><p class="text" style="margin-top:25px">Figures are reported in the supplied AFWL case study and describe that historical project, not a forecast for future partners.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="label">Historical partner feedback / 2024 media pack</div><h2 class="heading">Relationships<br>that endure.</h2><div class="quote-grid"><blockquote>“Presentation and unique access offered by BLUXE Century sets the bar very high.”<cite>Chris Bovey · The Resort Group</cite></blockquote><blockquote>“A highly effective avenue to gain traction in the Kenyan market.”<cite>Giles Beswick · Select Property Group</cite></blockquote><blockquote>“The BLUXE Century team added so much to our VIP event at the US embassy London.”<cite>Denise Harris · US Embassy London</cite></blockquote></div><p class="micro" style="margin-top:22px">Excerpted from the 2024 media pack; affiliations and current relationships should be reconfirmed before external sales use.</p><div class="hairline" style="margin:55px 0 25px"></div><div class="label">Names shown in the historical media materials</div><p class="text">The media pack displays Ferrari, Bonhams, Berkeley, St Edward, Vitamix, Select Property Group, The Resort Group and Eko Atlantic among its brand and client references. This archive list does not imply a current partnership.</p></div></section>'''

